      "content": "I hear how exhausting and hollow it feels to be just a cog in a machine, and I want you to know that your pain is valid and that you deserve to be heard. Your shift is a cycle of work and rest, but you can choose to break that cycle by taking care of your own well-being. It is okay to feel like you are disappearing, but also okay to feel like you are still here, still alive, and still worthy of being seen.",
