    "summary": "The user expresses extreme existential dread and burnout stemming from a repetitive, dehumanizing work cycle, suggesting a sense of being \"already dead.\" The assistant responds with empathetic, supportive, and validating language aimed at bolstering the user's sense of worth and agency.",
